      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Arriving at the Seminci film festival red carpet in Valladolid, Paquita hands Macarena over to festival coordinator Sofi and pretends she is driving back to Madrid for the wedding drinks. Before leaving, Paquita calls out across the crowd to let Macarena know she understands — telling her that whatever dress she wears, she will always look gorgeous. Listen to the Spanish first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Hola, Sofi, ¿qué tal? Oye, cuídamela.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sofi",
      "t": "Prometido.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "He pensado que mejor me vuelvo a Madrid.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "¿Por qué?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Porque estoy cansada. ¿Qué hago yo aquí vestida así?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Si me doy prisa, quizá llego a las copas de la boda.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "Sí, pero ¿estás bien?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Sí, de verdad, todo bien. Tú no te preocupes.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "Gracias por traerme.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¡Maca!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "¿Qué?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Que tú estás guapísima siempre.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Da igual el vestido que te pongas, estarás guapísima siempre.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "Gracias, Paquita.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Gracias a ti. Corre, venga.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through their farewell on the red carpet.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Hola, Sofi, ¿qué tal? Oye, cuídamela.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Sofi, how are things? Hey, take good care of her for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sofi",
      "t": "Prometido.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Promised.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "He pensado que mejor me vuelvo a Madrid.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I've decided I'd better head back to Madrid.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "¿Por qué?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Porque estoy cansada. ¿Qué hago yo aquí vestida así?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because I'm tired. What am I doing here dressed like this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Si me doy prisa, quizá llego a las copas de la boda.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I hurry, maybe I'll make the wedding drinks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "Sí, pero ¿estás bien?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, but are you alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Sí, de verdad, todo bien. Tú no te preocupes.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, honestly, everything's fine. Don't you worry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "Gracias por traerme.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for bringing me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¡Maca!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maca!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "¿Qué?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Que tú estás guapísima siempre.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You always look gorgeous.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Da igual el vestido que te pongas, estarás guapísima siempre.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Never mind which dress you put on, you'll always look gorgeous.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "macarena",
      "t": "Gracias, Paquita.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, Paquita.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Gracias a ti. Corre, venga.",
      "gap": 0.55
